#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Wenn du disse Instellen bruukst, üm en Programm to ümgahn, dat to faken na "
"Achtung fraagt, söök toeerst na en Instellen in dat Programm, üm dat "
"Verhollen aftoschalten. Wenn du keen finnst, överlegg, dat as Fehler an den "
"Entwickler vun dat Programm to melden."

#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:98
msgctxt "@info displayed as InlineMessage"
msgid ""
"The compositor does not support displaying windows side by side, so a "
"textual list will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"De Compositor ünnerstütt dat Sieden-an-Sieden-Wiesen vun Finstern nich, "
"dorüm warrt stattdessen en tekstliche List wiest."

